      "created_at": "2018-11-28T05:28:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think Iron Curtain II might be one of my fave new villains. The way she took her father’s last words completely the wrong way, and the fact the rest of the team don’t really like her much, would make her a fairly tragic character...except that from their descriptions she seems pretty upbeat, as villains go. I think she’s charming.</p>",
